WEBVTT

00:16.224 --> 00:23.231
ALARM

00:30.447 --> 00:32.532
I always pray before going to bed.

00:33.658 --> 00:36.369
I pray I get too sick
to get up in the morning…

00:39.039 --> 00:40.957
so that I can't go to school.

00:45.211 --> 00:46.463
I pray I have an accident

00:46.546 --> 00:49.716
and wake up two years later,
already graduated.

00:54.179 --> 00:55.889
I'm not afraid of dying.

00:55.972 --> 00:58.183
-Hello.
-Hello.

00:58.266 --> 00:59.684
That's because…

01:02.062 --> 01:03.897
school is hell, which is worse.

01:04.689 --> 01:07.025
-Isn't that Dae-seok?
-Hey, Dae-seok!

01:07.108 --> 01:09.277
-Dae-seok!
-Hey, step back from there!

01:09.360 --> 01:11.029
-Who's that?
-It's Dae-seok, right?

01:11.112 --> 01:12.864
-Get down. Stop!
-What are you doing?

01:12.947 --> 01:14.824
Park Dae-seok! That's dangerous!

01:14.908 --> 01:15.867
-Dae-seok!
-Watch out!

01:15.950 --> 01:17.410
-It's dangerous!
-Get down!

01:17.494 --> 01:19.120
Hey, shouldn't we call the police?

01:19.204 --> 01:20.038
Call them.

01:20.121 --> 01:21.164
Hey! Get down!

01:21.247 --> 01:24.167
From today, the Daehan High outcast is…

01:24.250 --> 01:27.378
Drumroll, please!

01:27.462 --> 01:29.839
Park Dae-seok!

01:29.923 --> 01:31.883
-Applause!
-Applause!

01:32.383 --> 01:35.470
We will now proceed
with the outcast stick transfer ceremony.

01:35.553 --> 01:37.931
Kim Gyeong-min, the former outcast.
Step forward!

01:38.890 --> 01:41.392
-Get up and take it.
-Get up, you rude bastard.

01:41.893 --> 01:43.686
Hand over the outcast stick!

01:47.023 --> 01:48.900
What do you think you're doing in class?

01:48.983 --> 01:50.652
A decreasing exponential function…

01:50.735 --> 01:52.362
Put your phone away already.

01:52.445 --> 01:54.656
Man, this online lecture
is way more helpful.

01:55.323 --> 01:56.574
You should teach better.

01:56.658 --> 01:58.284
X plus one and…

01:58.785 --> 02:00.120
Watch what you say.

02:00.203 --> 02:02.705
You're just a temp, not a real teacher.

02:04.874 --> 02:06.793
Want a permanent job? I can talk to Dad.

02:07.377 --> 02:09.295
Wow, what a sweet deal.

02:09.379 --> 02:10.672
So just

02:12.382 --> 02:14.259
cut the crap and carry on.

02:17.971 --> 02:19.681
I've had it with you, bastard.

02:19.764 --> 02:21.808
You'd be a helpless jerk without your dad.

02:24.686 --> 02:25.728
Dae-seok!

02:25.812 --> 02:27.897
Is this a mutiny? I like this.

02:27.981 --> 02:29.482
-All right!
-Gwang-su, stop it!

02:29.566 --> 02:31.484
-Why suddenly act up?
-Guys, help!

02:31.568 --> 02:33.319
-Why? You fucking bastard!
-Eyes ahead.

02:33.403 --> 02:34.863
Guys, help him!

02:34.946 --> 02:36.781
-Why now?
-You hear me?

02:36.865 --> 02:40.076
-Why is he being so cocky?
-Why are you all just watching?

02:45.582 --> 02:46.457
OUTCAST STICK

02:48.251 --> 02:51.171
I hope you'll be responsible
and do well in your new role.

02:51.254 --> 02:54.174
And that wraps up
the outcast stick transfer ceremony!

02:54.257 --> 02:55.717
Let's give it up for him!

02:58.720 --> 02:59.554
Dae-seok.

03:00.972 --> 03:02.098
Smile.

03:02.182 --> 03:03.683
You fucking bastard.

03:06.060 --> 03:07.020
Let's go say hi.

03:07.687 --> 03:10.565
Our dear Gyeong-min should join us.
Come on.

03:11.357 --> 03:13.401
Fuck yeah!

03:14.527 --> 03:18.531
Guys, starting today, this fucking bitch
is the new outcast at Daehan High.

03:18.615 --> 03:19.782
Say hello.

03:21.784 --> 03:23.119
Hello.

03:23.620 --> 03:26.122
I'm Park Dae-seok,
the outcast at Daehan High.

03:27.540 --> 03:28.833
It's a beautiful night.

03:28.917 --> 03:30.001
Applause!

03:36.758 --> 03:38.509
What is it? Do you need something?

03:40.011 --> 03:40.929
No, sir.

03:43.097 --> 03:45.975
How do you handle kids who misbehave?

03:46.059 --> 03:48.603
The idea of discipline or guidance
gives you a headache.

03:48.686 --> 03:51.439
Just give them penalty points.
Going by the book is easy.

03:51.522 --> 03:55.777
Ever since corporal punishment was banned,
schools have been a mess.

03:55.860 --> 03:58.488
If we discipline them even a bit,
they make such a fuss,

03:58.571 --> 04:01.366
accusing us of human rights violations
and child abuse.

04:01.449 --> 04:02.825
A teacher's passion?

04:04.369 --> 04:07.497
We'd be lucky not to get stabbed
by a student with scissors.

04:07.580 --> 04:09.499
-Two years ago…
-It happened to a teacher.

04:09.582 --> 04:11.334
Exactly. That's what would happen.

04:11.417 --> 04:13.127
It was horrific.

04:17.632 --> 04:18.925
This isn't right. Come down!

04:19.008 --> 04:21.344
-It's really dangerous!
-Get down!

04:23.137 --> 04:25.640
-It's dangerous!
-Get down, for God's sake!

04:49.664 --> 04:50.832
Hey, it's the police.

04:50.915 --> 04:52.667
-Where?
-No way. Really?

04:52.750 --> 04:55.878
-Are they here because of Park Dae-seok?
-So they're fucked?

04:55.962 --> 04:57.338
No way are we fucked, fuckers!

04:57.422 --> 04:59.924
Who did you say is fucked?
Fucking bastards!

05:00.008 --> 05:01.968
Sit down! Sit the fuck down!

05:14.939 --> 05:17.608
Welcome back to being the fucking outcast!

05:20.361 --> 05:22.864
It looks best
on our dear Gyeong-min for sure.

05:23.364 --> 05:24.699
Hey, you fucking bitch!

05:24.782 --> 05:26.284
What's with that look?

05:26.784 --> 05:28.328
Did you get your hopes up?

05:28.411 --> 05:31.789
Like the fucking cops would question us
and throw us in jail?

05:31.873 --> 05:33.916
You thought
you could finally relax at school?

05:34.000 --> 05:34.876
Is that fucking it?

05:35.460 --> 05:36.461
Huh?

05:36.544 --> 05:40.340
Fucking hell! Losers never fucking learn.

05:40.840 --> 05:42.759
You think this is a big fucking deal?

05:42.842 --> 05:44.260
But fuck!

05:45.136 --> 05:46.346
Nothing will change here.

05:46.929 --> 05:48.473
Don't get angry. Okay?

05:48.556 --> 05:50.600
He's got a lot to do,
being the outcast again.

05:50.683 --> 05:52.310
We should congratulate him.

05:53.019 --> 05:54.979
Gyeong-min, have you ever had a drink?

05:55.063 --> 05:56.981
Hey, I'll buy you some.

05:57.065 --> 05:59.525
Oh fuck!

05:59.609 --> 06:01.736
We brought this with us.

06:01.819 --> 06:03.780
Drink this, and you'll be an adult, okay?

06:03.863 --> 06:05.198
-Don't.
-Let's drink up.

06:05.281 --> 06:06.991
-It'll be fine. Drink up.
-Sit still.

06:08.284 --> 06:09.369
Down it goes.

06:10.411 --> 06:11.287
Man, what a waste!

06:11.371 --> 06:12.914
I think he smells like alcohol.

06:12.997 --> 06:14.165
Snap out of it, dude.

06:14.248 --> 06:15.375
Go and wash your face.

06:17.794 --> 06:18.628
Quiet.

06:22.131 --> 06:23.132
Get a grip!

07:02.797 --> 07:04.340
Sexy Gyeong-min!

07:07.385 --> 07:09.470
MMA has made
my strength uncontrollable. Sorry.

07:10.304 --> 07:11.139
It's…

07:11.681 --> 07:14.225
-It's…
-Your stammering makes me feel worse.

07:14.308 --> 07:16.352
-I said I'm sorry.
-It's fine.

07:19.355 --> 07:21.482
Nah, you should just hit me too. Okay?

07:22.150 --> 07:22.984
No, it's okay.

07:23.067 --> 07:25.695
No, I'm not okay with it.
Bet you'll post about this later.

07:25.778 --> 07:27.530
-No, I won't.
-Just hit me, dumbass.

07:27.613 --> 07:28.906
Hit me. It's okay.

07:28.990 --> 07:30.450
Hurry up and hit me.

07:30.533 --> 07:32.243
-Hey, hit me.
-What's his deal?

07:32.326 --> 07:33.411
Come on.

07:34.078 --> 07:36.414
Man, sorry. How many times did I tell you?

07:36.497 --> 07:39.792
Hit me. Slap me like this. Come on.

07:40.877 --> 07:43.588
Hey, lift your head. Let me see.

07:43.671 --> 07:45.381
Let me see, you fucking bastard.

07:46.382 --> 07:47.717
Damn it.

07:47.800 --> 07:49.469
You're fine. It's all good.

07:49.552 --> 07:52.096
Hey, come here. Up you get.
Let me show you.

07:52.180 --> 07:55.224
When you hit someone,
you look them in the eye.

07:56.184 --> 07:57.018
Hit me.

08:00.021 --> 08:01.105
Yeah!

08:01.189 --> 08:02.106
Damn it.

08:02.190 --> 08:04.025
Hey, let's try that again. Once more.

08:05.651 --> 08:08.654
Fucking hell. Come on, don't cry.

08:08.738 --> 08:10.239
Fine. I'll close my eyes.

08:10.740 --> 08:11.574
Here.

08:11.657 --> 08:13.743
Come on, hit me.

08:13.826 --> 08:16.162
Just hit me, you fucking bastard!

08:16.662 --> 08:18.789
Just hit me, you bastard. Come on.

08:24.378 --> 08:26.589
Fuck, what the hell!

08:26.672 --> 08:27.798
Hey, Gwang-su got hit.

08:30.301 --> 08:31.219
Who is that?

08:32.470 --> 08:33.846
-Who is it?
-Who is it?

08:43.773 --> 08:44.899
Did you just hit me?

08:47.276 --> 08:48.236
Who the hell are you?

08:49.403 --> 08:50.279
You a teacher?

08:50.363 --> 08:52.323
Do not speak rudely to your elders!

09:07.755 --> 09:08.631
Fuck.

09:09.632 --> 09:10.633
Fucking hell!

09:19.183 --> 09:21.769
Don't film this. Stop fucking filming!

09:24.981 --> 09:25.940
You…

09:26.023 --> 09:28.568
You must not run in the hallways.

09:28.651 --> 09:29.527
Fuck you!

09:56.220 --> 09:59.682
You must not cause
a disturbance at school.

10:05.521 --> 10:07.356
-Jun-hyeong's here.
-It's Jun-hyeong.

10:12.028 --> 10:12.862
What now?

10:13.446 --> 10:15.865
Who the hell are you?

10:15.948 --> 10:18.075
I was assigned to this school today.

10:18.159 --> 10:22.788
So you're… a teacher.
Teachers shouldn't hit students.

10:22.872 --> 10:24.248
Hey, record this.

10:24.332 --> 10:25.708
-Okay.
-Guys, start filming.

10:26.542 --> 10:28.461
Hey, get it on camera.

10:33.633 --> 10:35.885
Can't you hit since you're on camera?

10:36.385 --> 10:38.179
Hit me again, you crazy bastard.

10:39.305 --> 10:41.766
All right. Fine, then.

10:41.849 --> 10:43.184
Here. Gosh.

10:43.267 --> 10:44.310
There you go.

10:51.233 --> 10:52.777
Then I won't say no.

10:58.616 --> 11:00.451
You know those things called Shorts?

11:00.534 --> 11:02.119
TEACHING A LESSON
STUDENT ASSAULT

11:02.203 --> 11:03.120
THE GRIM REAPER

11:03.204 --> 11:04.538
WHACK! YET TO START
THRILLING! SPICY!

11:04.622 --> 11:06.499
Now the other side!

11:06.582 --> 11:07.667
SLAP

11:07.750 --> 11:09.919
WHO'S THE ABUSIVE TEACHER?
SLAPPING ARTIST

11:10.711 --> 11:11.671
SMILE OR GET F***ED

11:11.754 --> 11:13.881
I'll get ahold of myself and behave.

11:13.964 --> 11:15.383
-Heart pose.
-Teacher's coming.

11:15.466 --> 11:16.676
-What is this?
-Heart pose.

11:16.759 --> 11:17.885
-Move it!
-He's nuts.

11:18.386 --> 11:19.929
What's going on? Who are you?

11:20.429 --> 11:22.390
-What happened?
-What happened to your face?

11:22.473 --> 11:26.102
-Who gave you the right to do this?
-Just a moment, please.

11:26.185 --> 11:28.145
He says he's a newly appointed teacher.

11:28.229 --> 11:30.898
Newly appointed? That's news to me.

11:30.981 --> 11:32.233
Who the hell are you?

11:32.316 --> 11:34.360
Hang on, it's here somewhere…

11:35.027 --> 11:35.861
That's right.

11:37.988 --> 11:39.031
It's around my neck.

11:42.284 --> 11:45.538
I'm an inspector from the Korean
Educational Rights Protection Bureau.

11:47.832 --> 11:49.291
My name is Na Hwa-jin.

11:49.375 --> 11:50.835
The ERPB?

11:51.627 --> 11:53.212
Have you heard of it?

11:53.295 --> 11:54.797
No, I haven't.

11:54.880 --> 11:57.883
Of course you haven't.
It was just established.

11:57.967 --> 11:59.802
So what on earth is this bureau?

11:59.885 --> 12:02.722
I should explain properly.
But it's my first time, you see.

12:04.223 --> 12:07.476
We provide specialized guidance
to trashy schools

12:07.560 --> 12:11.147
that pay off the police
to sweep incidents under the rug,

12:11.230 --> 12:13.399
even when a student dies.

12:13.482 --> 12:15.067
Not only did that never happen,

12:15.151 --> 12:18.487
but is a teacher even allowed
to beat a kid like this?

12:18.571 --> 12:19.780
It's allowed.

12:20.364 --> 12:23.451
The ERPB inspector
holds one special authority.

12:23.534 --> 12:26.829
"There is no limit whatsoever
to teaching methods."

12:27.329 --> 12:29.248
Simply put,

12:29.874 --> 12:32.918
if they listen to words,
you teach with words.

12:33.627 --> 12:36.922
If they listen only after a beating,
then you teach by beating.

12:38.883 --> 12:43.429
All right. Starting today,
the ERPB will teach this school…

12:45.973 --> 12:48.309
a proper lesson.

12:55.941 --> 12:59.570
TEACH YOU A LESSON

13:00.946 --> 13:01.947
Gosh.

13:03.199 --> 13:05.493
So this organization actually exists.

13:06.619 --> 13:09.163
There seems to be
some kind of misunderstanding.

13:09.246 --> 13:11.791
Bullies? School violence?

13:11.874 --> 13:15.503
It's impossible for such things
to happen at this school.

13:15.586 --> 13:17.546
Our students are of a very high standard.

13:17.630 --> 13:20.341
Many parents are prominent
political or business figures,

13:20.424 --> 13:22.259
including a National Assembly member.

13:22.343 --> 13:24.720
Park Dae-seok was in second grade,
class 5, right?

13:24.804 --> 13:27.014
As of today,
I'll be the teacher of that class.

13:27.097 --> 13:31.602
The parents of our students
absolutely hate trouble and drama.

13:31.685 --> 13:34.814
There will be uproar
if the students' grades drop.

13:37.191 --> 13:38.859
Is that what you're afraid of?

13:40.486 --> 13:41.529
Their grades?

13:42.112 --> 13:45.407
The National Assembly member's son
is in that class.

13:45.491 --> 13:47.785
You must know Assemblyman Ryu Gwang-pil.

13:47.868 --> 13:50.204
The next presidential candidate.
A political titan.

13:52.373 --> 13:55.000
You and I are both just salary earners.

13:57.253 --> 13:59.213
That is a little scary, isn't it?

13:59.296 --> 14:02.174
We should be scared.
He's a strong presidential candidate.

14:02.258 --> 14:03.342
Mr. Kim.

14:03.843 --> 14:06.303
If adults become afraid of children…

14:08.389 --> 14:10.391
the world is doomed.

14:12.893 --> 14:16.647
Fucking hell.
The ringing in my ears won't fucking stop.

14:16.730 --> 14:19.066
Hey, the ERPB doesn't seem to exist.

14:19.149 --> 14:21.777
If it does exist,
what the fuck are they going to do?

14:21.861 --> 14:24.572
Fuck yeah.
They're all beneath your dad, aren't they?

14:34.206 --> 14:37.084
You'll remember me from earlier.

14:37.167 --> 14:38.794
I'm your homeroom teacher now.

14:38.878 --> 14:41.088
We're fucked. Damn it.

14:41.171 --> 14:42.840
Thanks for the warm welcome.

14:42.923 --> 14:44.675
All right, let's take attendance.

14:44.758 --> 14:46.510
-Ko Gyeong-chan.
-Here.

14:46.594 --> 14:48.345
-Kim Gyeong-min.
-Here.

14:50.264 --> 14:52.516
-Kim Gwang-su.
-Here.

14:54.101 --> 14:56.270
Oh, Gwang-su?

14:56.979 --> 14:58.731
-Kim Na-rae.
-Here.

14:58.814 --> 14:59.982
Ryu Jun-hyeong.

15:06.447 --> 15:07.323
Park Dae-seok.

15:12.786 --> 15:13.996
That's right.

15:14.079 --> 15:15.581
Dae-seok's dead, isn't he?

15:16.540 --> 15:19.543
Do you guys know
why Dae-seok ended up like that?

15:19.627 --> 15:22.421
I heard he killed himself
because of stress from grades.

15:22.504 --> 15:24.548
Is that right?

15:25.674 --> 15:28.594
Or maybe Dae-seok killed himself

15:29.094 --> 15:31.138
because one of you guys

15:31.847 --> 15:33.390
bullied and ostracized him

15:35.059 --> 15:37.436
until he couldn't take it anymore?

15:37.519 --> 15:39.647
No, that's not it at all.

15:39.730 --> 15:42.691
He was a stupid dumbass
and didn't want to take the mock exams.

15:42.775 --> 15:46.111
So whoosh and splat,
he fell off the school roof and died.

15:46.195 --> 15:47.947
Jesus, that trap of yours.

15:48.030 --> 15:51.492
-It's so unkind.
-Wait a minute. Wait.

15:51.992 --> 15:52.910
Don't you think?

15:58.540 --> 16:00.459
You guys are really amazing.

16:00.542 --> 16:03.212
All the talent ERPB is looking for
is right here.

16:03.712 --> 16:06.590
You see teachers as morons.

16:06.674 --> 16:09.051
You proudly uphold
the tradition of bullying.

16:09.134 --> 16:10.177
You fucking bastard.

16:14.306 --> 16:18.811
And you remain completely unfazed
even when a classmate dies.

16:18.894 --> 16:21.397
You guys really are amazing. That's right.

16:23.857 --> 16:24.984
You look remorseful.

16:26.110 --> 16:30.447
Remorse is something you do
with your body, not your mind.

16:31.281 --> 16:33.701
Shall we all get into a plank position?

16:34.410 --> 16:36.036
On three.

16:36.870 --> 16:37.871
Three!

16:41.333 --> 16:42.501
Sit down.

16:46.839 --> 16:47.756
Sit down!

16:55.514 --> 16:57.307
The mock exams are around the corner.

16:57.391 --> 16:58.767
Can you just start the lesson?

16:59.435 --> 17:01.437
It's not like the ERPB
will own our grades.

17:01.520 --> 17:03.313
I'm sure I said, "Three."

17:05.816 --> 17:06.692
Oh no.

17:06.775 --> 17:08.819
These jerks seem more afraid
of me than you.

17:08.902 --> 17:10.821
Actually, this is great.

17:11.572 --> 17:15.659
That means if one kid feels intimidated,
everyone else feels that way too.

17:16.160 --> 17:18.370
But would that work? It's just that…

17:20.539 --> 17:22.332
I don't fear a damn thing.

17:24.293 --> 17:27.129
Fear comes from experience.

17:39.767 --> 17:40.768
Let go of me.

17:45.439 --> 17:47.274
Do you know who you're messing with?

17:47.357 --> 17:49.359
Who else but a student?

17:49.443 --> 17:50.569
Aren't you a student?

17:52.738 --> 17:54.782
Every single day from now on…

17:56.408 --> 17:57.659
will be like hell.

18:06.460 --> 18:08.462
All right. Three!

18:15.385 --> 18:16.720
This is the last time.

18:19.139 --> 18:20.015
Three.

18:36.990 --> 18:39.326
100 GLORIOUS YEARS OF DAEHAN
MAY IT THRIVE FOREVER

18:39.409 --> 18:40.452
Thank you.

18:40.953 --> 18:42.538
-Care for more?
-Thank you.

18:42.621 --> 18:44.289
Enjoy your meal.

18:45.833 --> 18:48.460
-Sure, no problem. Eat up.
-Thank you.

18:49.336 --> 18:50.170
Thanks. Fuck off.

18:50.254 --> 18:51.547
Sure. Eat up.

18:52.422 --> 18:54.591
-Enjoy your meal.
-I will.

18:55.092 --> 18:56.385
Thank you.

19:01.557 --> 19:05.144
Man, how come everything you do
is just nasty?

19:05.227 --> 19:06.812
What, still an a-hole at 18?

19:09.106 --> 19:11.441
-Fucker.
-Do you want to be forced to the back?

19:11.525 --> 19:12.901
No one is complaining.

19:15.737 --> 19:19.950
Power is really scary, isn't it?

19:21.660 --> 19:23.036
But power isn't for students.

19:23.120 --> 19:26.540
If you want lunch,
go all the way to the back and line up.

19:27.374 --> 19:28.292
Or you'll get none.

19:34.756 --> 19:36.341
Oh my goodness.

19:49.104 --> 19:52.524
Oh, sorry. I can't stand people
who play with their food.

19:52.608 --> 19:54.234
Look at you.

19:54.318 --> 19:55.819
Your clothes got all dirty.

19:55.903 --> 19:59.281
You don't have ten school uniforms
for being a politician's son, right?

19:59.364 --> 20:00.657
Come here. Let me get that.

20:00.741 --> 20:02.284
Seriously, man.

20:02.367 --> 20:05.329
This is why
you shouldn't play with your food.

20:05.412 --> 20:07.039
There's some scallion on your face.

20:07.664 --> 20:08.707
Put this on your head.

20:09.708 --> 20:10.542
How pretty.

20:10.626 --> 20:12.669
Jun-hyeong looks so cute like this.

20:13.170 --> 20:14.379
Guys, it's photo time.

20:15.214 --> 20:17.674
How about making some Shorts?

20:17.758 --> 20:19.718
Just like our lovely Jun-hyeong here,

20:19.801 --> 20:22.846
let's mind our manners
and eat with grateful hearts. Okay?

20:22.930 --> 20:25.265
You made this mess. You clean it up.

20:26.016 --> 20:27.309
Let's eat!

20:27.809 --> 20:28.644
Line up!

20:41.448 --> 20:42.908
You must be fucking excited.

20:44.201 --> 20:45.285
No.

20:46.286 --> 20:47.162
No what?

20:50.874 --> 20:52.709
I asked what you mean by "no."

20:54.836 --> 20:55.712
Huh?

20:56.255 --> 20:57.589
Fuck off, you dumbass.

20:58.465 --> 20:59.299
Yes, sir.

21:01.551 --> 21:02.427
Okay.

21:10.185 --> 21:12.521
Fucking outcast.

21:20.445 --> 21:21.488
Honey!

21:28.537 --> 21:29.663
Who is it?

21:29.746 --> 21:31.999
Is this the home
of Assemblyman Ryu Gwang-pil,

21:32.082 --> 21:34.209
the strong presidential candidate?

21:36.128 --> 21:38.714
Wow, these are actually real,

21:38.797 --> 21:40.424
not just for decoration.

21:40.507 --> 21:43.677
I mean, you always see these
in soap operas.

21:43.760 --> 21:46.763
You know, I've always been curious.

21:48.890 --> 21:50.183
It tastes great.

21:55.564 --> 21:56.398
Jun-hyeong.

21:57.566 --> 22:01.862
Now that Jun-hyeong is here,
please tell us what brings you here.

22:01.945 --> 22:02.946
All right.

22:04.406 --> 22:08.327
Our dear Jun-hyeong here
left without doing his cleaning duties.

22:09.703 --> 22:13.165
"All students are equal.
Students shouldn't have power."

22:13.248 --> 22:15.375
I've told him so many times. You brat.

22:16.710 --> 22:20.297
Giving up power
seems like a hard thing to do.

22:23.258 --> 22:26.261
"People as People, Politics as Politics."

22:26.345 --> 22:30.390
This was your campaign slogan
in the last election, wasn't it?

22:30.474 --> 22:32.517
I share a similar philosophy.

22:32.601 --> 22:34.978
"Teachers as Teachers." You see?

22:35.645 --> 22:38.857
"Students as Students," you punk!

22:41.443 --> 22:46.281
So I'm just here to get the student
who didn't clean up, as a teacher should.

22:46.365 --> 22:48.450
He's deliberately after me, picking on me,

22:48.533 --> 22:50.786
trying to tie me
to the Park Dae-seok case!

22:57.334 --> 22:58.585
That was delicious.

22:59.586 --> 23:01.797
I'll take him with me,
as a teacher should.

23:02.381 --> 23:03.924
Let's go. Come on.

23:05.342 --> 23:06.885
You're making a mistake.

23:06.968 --> 23:10.389
I'll guide Jun-hyeong well from now on
without any mistakes.

23:10.472 --> 23:12.432
-Doors closing.
-They're closing.

23:12.516 --> 23:14.267
You should hold it, punk!

23:15.727 --> 23:17.979
I'll see you again. Come on, let's go.

23:18.063 --> 23:19.189
-Let go!
-Which floor?

23:19.272 --> 23:20.107
Doors closing.

23:20.690 --> 23:21.983
The doors are so slow.

23:28.073 --> 23:32.077
These should remain a mess
so that we can keep the story moving.

23:33.870 --> 23:35.622
But they're too clean for that.

23:36.415 --> 23:38.625
You do well when you try. Okay, then.

23:38.708 --> 23:41.711
Finish up here
and put those cleaning supplies away.

23:55.267 --> 23:57.269
STUDENT RECORD

23:57.894 --> 24:01.565
STUDENT NAME: PARK DAE-SEOK

24:06.820 --> 24:08.363
Choi Gang-seok.

24:10.866 --> 24:14.578
It seems Minister Choi Gang-seok
took the lead in setting up the ERPB.

24:15.078 --> 24:17.247
And it seems
you're not a qualified teacher.

24:17.330 --> 24:20.542
I'm treated as a teacher
during the investigation period.

24:20.625 --> 24:22.043
I'm sure you already know that.

24:23.128 --> 24:27.257
You'll have to explain what happened
to my son's head.

24:28.216 --> 24:29.593
Well, I'm not sure.

24:29.676 --> 24:32.554
I told him to clean the toilet,
not to slam his head against it.

24:32.637 --> 24:35.891
Are you saying my son hurt himself
on purpose to frame you?

24:35.974 --> 24:39.603
He might find it easy to hit others,
but he must've been scared to hit himself.

24:39.686 --> 24:43.273
How should I put this?
His injury looks forced.

24:52.824 --> 24:54.409
You act like nothing scares you.

24:54.493 --> 24:58.747
If a doctor is afraid of their patients,
they can't treat them properly.

24:59.706 --> 25:03.627
If a lawyer is afraid of their clients,
they can't defend them properly.

25:05.003 --> 25:08.048
So if a teacher
is afraid of their students,

25:08.965 --> 25:10.592
can they teach them properly?

25:13.845 --> 25:15.639
I'm sure you fully understand

25:16.723 --> 25:18.725
what it means for me to get involved.

25:22.062 --> 25:24.773
The ERPB is a national organization.

25:26.191 --> 25:27.901
You'll have to take on the nation.

25:27.984 --> 25:30.278
It's something I'm well-versed in.

25:30.362 --> 25:31.196
That's great.

25:52.300 --> 25:55.095
So you're the one
who snitched to the ERPB, you bitch.

25:56.054 --> 25:56.888
It wasn't me.

25:56.972 --> 25:58.306
Yeah, right.

25:58.390 --> 26:01.226
Jun-hyeong's father came to school,
all fucking because of you.

26:01.309 --> 26:02.561
You want to join Dae-seok?

26:02.644 --> 26:04.437
-It really wasn't me. Really…
-Here.

26:06.606 --> 26:07.440
Hey.

26:07.524 --> 26:08.942
-Are you sure?
-Hey, come here.

26:09.025 --> 26:11.361
Whether you fucking snitched or not
doesn't matter.

26:11.444 --> 26:13.530
Fucking hell. I treated you…

26:13.613 --> 26:16.157
Fuck, I was so good to you.

26:16.241 --> 26:17.826
-Hey, just go.
-Fucking bitch!

26:17.909 --> 26:19.661
-Get lost!
-You fucking bitch.

26:19.744 --> 26:21.121
You fucker!

26:21.204 --> 26:22.914
Hey, look here.

26:22.998 --> 26:26.084
-Lift your head.
-Fucking bastard.

26:26.960 --> 26:29.087
-Hey, come on.
-You fucker.

26:53.612 --> 26:56.114
Oh man, kiddo. You're a real handful.

26:56.740 --> 26:58.158
What next? Let go or pull?

26:58.241 --> 27:00.160
Pull!

27:00.243 --> 27:01.870
Where are your manners?

27:01.953 --> 27:03.121
Please pull!

27:17.302 --> 27:18.178
Follow me.

27:25.518 --> 27:30.273
It looks like you always get beaten up
by Jun-hyeong's gang. Right?

27:33.735 --> 27:37.280
How long do you plan
on getting beaten up for?

27:38.573 --> 27:40.659
Don't talk like that
when you've got no idea.

27:41.368 --> 27:42.577
What if I do fight back?

27:42.661 --> 27:44.913
Do you think that changes anything?

27:45.413 --> 27:47.332
Who said anything about fighting back?

27:48.083 --> 27:49.084
Make a break for it.

27:50.335 --> 27:52.045
Those who tell you to fight back

27:52.128 --> 27:55.423
clearly have never been
beaten up themselves.

27:56.132 --> 27:57.509
But it'll only get worse.

27:57.592 --> 27:58.885
You can run away then too.

27:58.968 --> 28:00.845
So just keep running away forever?

28:01.346 --> 28:03.598
You're right. You can't keep running away.

28:04.099 --> 28:05.266
So you need to

28:06.184 --> 28:07.602
tell an adult.

28:08.311 --> 28:09.646
It's no use.

28:09.729 --> 28:11.856
Keep telling them until it's of use.

28:14.067 --> 28:15.944
There are good adults out there too.

28:20.740 --> 28:22.784
Now, for this reason,

28:22.867 --> 28:25.954
you'll start intense running training
starting today.

28:26.579 --> 28:28.081
Do you see that soccer goal?

28:28.581 --> 28:30.542
Run there and back. You have ten seconds.

28:31.376 --> 28:32.210
Sorry?

28:32.293 --> 28:33.878
Run. Why aren't you running?

28:34.379 --> 28:35.463
Run!

28:35.547 --> 28:37.173
Run. Come on, faster.

28:37.257 --> 28:38.508
I said faster!

28:38.591 --> 28:40.051
I'll set the dog on you.

28:40.552 --> 28:43.847
-Where's the dog?
-Me. I'm a mad dog.

28:44.389 --> 28:45.432
Hurry up, man!

28:48.518 --> 28:50.520
Are you sure you can manage on your own?

28:50.603 --> 28:51.813
Yes, sir.

28:51.896 --> 28:53.440
That's right. You can do it.

28:54.232 --> 28:56.818
You did it earlier too. That's it. Good.

28:57.986 --> 28:58.945
Nicely set out.

28:59.529 --> 29:02.532
Maybe it's your experience as a gofer.
Your service is perfect.

29:03.616 --> 29:05.243
You're just like them, you know.

29:05.326 --> 29:06.953
No, I'm not, kiddo.

29:07.036 --> 29:09.748
I'm a teacher,
and they're just pathetic bullies.

29:11.833 --> 29:13.585
They're not all that pathetic.

29:14.294 --> 29:15.920
They're extremely powerful.

29:18.047 --> 29:21.676
Jun-hyeong's father
can ruin a whole family without trying.

29:21.760 --> 29:24.262
Don't worry about
that kind of thing, all right?

29:24.804 --> 29:26.389
I've got big guns backing me too.

29:27.974 --> 29:29.684
Lucky you, having such a thing.

29:32.061 --> 29:33.021
Gyeong-min.

29:34.063 --> 29:36.024
You've got big guns backing you too.

29:37.817 --> 29:38.651
Who?

29:41.488 --> 29:42.614
Don't you know?

29:43.698 --> 29:45.492
Look around you.

29:46.659 --> 29:48.495
They're not that far. Look closer.

29:53.500 --> 29:56.503
Who would be a student's big gun?
Their teacher.

29:57.086 --> 29:58.713
Seriously, man.

29:58.797 --> 30:03.259
Here, your supportive big gun
has peeled it just for you.

30:03.343 --> 30:04.803
Right, thank you.

30:10.725 --> 30:14.020
Gyeong-min, how is it
that you don't have a single friend

30:14.103 --> 30:16.147
you can confide in? Huh?

30:18.399 --> 30:20.193
I wasn't always ostracized.

30:23.780 --> 30:27.075
Why haven't you told your parents?
Because they'd be worried?

30:40.588 --> 30:44.384
DARLING SON
ENJOY YOUR DAY!

30:48.763 --> 30:50.014
Oh, I don't know.

30:51.140 --> 30:52.976
Just eat your ramyeon. It'll get soggy.

30:59.357 --> 31:00.233
All right.

31:13.746 --> 31:17.041
MINISTRY OF EDUCATION

31:19.335 --> 31:21.754
Wait! Just a moment, Mr. Ryu!

31:24.716 --> 31:25.550
Hello.

31:26.676 --> 31:28.678
What brings you here, Assemblyman Ryu?

31:28.761 --> 31:30.847
The Educational Rights Protection Bureau.

31:31.389 --> 31:33.016
Is it true you created it?

31:37.979 --> 31:40.148
Well, I suppose I did.

31:40.732 --> 31:42.275
Would you like a cup of tea?

31:42.358 --> 31:44.652
I didn't come here to drink tea.

31:46.738 --> 31:48.323
Don't stand there. Take a seat.

31:52.410 --> 31:54.829
Why on earth did you create such a thing?

31:57.457 --> 31:59.250
Because I felt bad.

32:00.418 --> 32:02.170
I'm sure you remember too.

32:02.837 --> 32:07.050
There was a case two years ago
where a teacher was murdered at school

32:07.133 --> 32:08.343
by their own student.

32:09.260 --> 32:12.180
I thought teachers' rights
needed to be clearly established

32:12.263 --> 32:14.057
so nothing like that happens again.

32:14.140 --> 32:15.892
But why Daehan High of all places?

32:15.975 --> 32:18.269
My son is suffering
because of it right now.

32:19.437 --> 32:21.606
Does your son go to Daehan High?

32:23.358 --> 32:24.442
Oh dear.

32:25.902 --> 32:27.612
The inspector has been going too far.

32:27.695 --> 32:30.448
If this is publicized,
public criticism will grow fierce.

32:30.531 --> 32:32.283
Nothing good can come from this.

32:32.367 --> 32:34.243
So why don't you just end it here?

32:37.246 --> 32:40.375
Well, there are a lot of eyes on us,

32:40.458 --> 32:43.294
and the organization
has just been established.

32:43.378 --> 32:45.672
How about we just wait a little longer?

32:45.755 --> 32:48.424
You know I have respect for you, Minister.

32:49.592 --> 32:51.803
I'm telling you all this for your sake.

32:51.886 --> 32:55.431
You wouldn't want to retire from politics
over something like this.

33:01.521 --> 33:03.314
A father would do anything

33:04.232 --> 33:05.817
for his child.

33:16.995 --> 33:19.455
This is Ryu Gwang-pil
of the Happiness Hope Party.

33:19.539 --> 33:21.332
Please support him.

33:21.958 --> 33:23.543
-Thank you.
-What's the time?

33:24.043 --> 33:25.420
Shouldn't he be here by now?

33:25.920 --> 33:28.631
-Come on, set your phones to vibrate.
-Sorry.

33:28.715 --> 33:31.467
People as People, Politics as Politics.

33:31.551 --> 33:34.220
What's this?
"Using aides for personal matters"?

33:34.303 --> 33:37.306
"Bribery in exchange
for local election nomination"?

33:38.016 --> 33:40.393
-Sexual harassment?
-What's this about?

33:40.476 --> 33:45.857
Ryu Gwang-pil!

33:45.940 --> 33:47.775
Thank you for taking the time to come.

33:47.859 --> 33:50.445
Do you admit to the bribery allegations?

33:50.528 --> 33:52.655
-What do you mean?
-There has been a tip-off.

33:52.739 --> 33:54.282
It's about your sexual misconduct.

33:54.866 --> 33:57.618
Is it true that you engaged
in illegal property speculation?

33:57.702 --> 33:59.078
What the hell is going on?

33:59.162 --> 34:00.872
I'll look into it. You should go.

34:00.955 --> 34:03.458
-Hurry and block them off here!
-Don't push!

34:03.541 --> 34:05.376
Do you admit it? Please say something!

34:05.460 --> 34:06.878
Assemblyman Ryu!

34:09.088 --> 34:10.423
Damn it.

34:48.252 --> 34:49.670
What's going on?

34:49.754 --> 34:51.130
It's noisy out there.

34:51.214 --> 34:52.840
There's no need for you to know.

34:53.591 --> 34:55.301
It'd be best if you left now.

34:57.261 --> 35:00.807
You must be a little slow on the uptake.

35:11.818 --> 35:12.777
Don't tell me

35:14.362 --> 35:16.072
you're behind this?

35:16.572 --> 35:18.783
Who put you up to this?

35:27.875 --> 35:29.836
It took me two years…

35:31.796 --> 35:33.172
to create the ERPB.

35:34.465 --> 35:35.716
It turns out

35:36.342 --> 35:38.302
two years is quite a long time.

35:49.105 --> 35:51.607
RYU GWANG-PIL
UNOFFICIAL REPORT

35:53.359 --> 35:54.861
RECORDING OF VICTIM INTERVIEW

35:59.115 --> 36:01.075
RYU GWANG-PIL
NOMINATION CORRUPTION REPORT

36:05.163 --> 36:06.289
Are you crazy?

36:06.372 --> 36:08.875
You and I are on the same side!

36:09.375 --> 36:12.128
We're in the same party, for fuck's sake!

36:12.211 --> 36:13.212
Assemblyman Ryu.

36:13.963 --> 36:17.300
There is no such thing as sides
when it comes to education.

36:17.383 --> 36:19.886
Was I your target from the very beginning?

36:19.969 --> 36:21.053
Just why?

36:21.137 --> 36:22.930
What the hell have I done so wrong?

36:23.514 --> 36:25.308
Are you serious or full of baloney?

36:26.100 --> 36:28.936
Your wrongdoings
should be all over the news by now.

36:31.355 --> 36:33.191
Shit, this is fucked up!

36:33.733 --> 36:36.068
There are so many people
worse than me out there!

36:36.569 --> 36:38.946
So why the hell are you doing this to me?

36:47.205 --> 36:49.457
That's because

36:50.416 --> 36:51.834
when you fall,

36:53.169 --> 36:54.754
your son falls too.

37:00.384 --> 37:04.680
You really should've educated
that brat of yours better.

37:17.109 --> 37:18.653
-Minister.
-Please step aside.

37:21.822 --> 37:23.032
Damn it!

37:23.115 --> 37:24.742
-Are you there?
-Sir!

37:25.743 --> 37:26.786
Just a moment!

37:26.869 --> 37:30.539
The National Assembly approved
an arrest motion of Ryu Gwang-pil,

37:30.623 --> 37:32.124
who faces corruption allegations.

37:32.708 --> 37:35.169
Furthermore, there have been allegations

37:35.253 --> 37:37.797
that Ryu's son was responsible
for the school bullying

37:37.880 --> 37:40.132
that resulted
in the death of his classmate,

37:40.216 --> 37:41.717
shocking the public even more.

37:41.801 --> 37:44.220
This case, which almost got buried,

37:44.303 --> 37:47.056
surfaced through an investigation
by the ERPB.

37:47.139 --> 37:51.352
The ERPB, a new agency
led by the Minister of Education,

37:51.435 --> 37:54.814
will handle the independent
and prompt protection of teachers' rights.

37:54.897 --> 37:58.234
It is responsible for receiving reports,
investigating, and responding--

38:00.903 --> 38:03.572
This might also turn
into a political issue.

38:04.240 --> 38:05.283
Would you be okay?

38:05.366 --> 38:08.160
I'll take all the bullets and missiles.

38:08.869 --> 38:10.246
You just get the job done.

38:13.040 --> 38:15.293
Like you've ever been shot.

38:16.043 --> 38:18.713
If you get shot,
you'll actually die of pain.

38:19.964 --> 38:21.674
It's just a metaphor.

38:23.467 --> 38:24.635
I won't really take it.

38:24.719 --> 38:26.387
I was using a metaphor too.

38:26.470 --> 38:27.930
Thank you for your effort.

38:39.734 --> 38:41.861
Hey, did you guys see this?

38:41.944 --> 38:44.780
As of today, the Daehan High outcast is…

38:44.864 --> 38:47.700
Cutie Pie! Applause!

38:48.492 --> 38:50.786
Hey, it looks best on you so far.

38:54.540 --> 38:56.792
Our dear Jun-hyeong, where are you going?

38:57.293 --> 39:00.004
He's fucking nothing without his dad!

39:00.087 --> 39:01.630
It stinks like trash.

39:02.798 --> 39:05.926
OUTCAST STICK

39:52.515 --> 39:53.974
It's not your fault.

40:02.942 --> 40:04.026
Gyeong-min.

40:06.570 --> 40:07.988
It's not your fault.

40:17.456 --> 40:19.625
When Dae-seok became the outcast,

40:21.168 --> 40:22.837
I was relieved.

40:24.255 --> 40:25.589
When he died,

40:26.757 --> 40:28.259
I couldn't help but smile.

40:30.845 --> 40:34.014
I thought I'd be able to break free
from this hell.

40:38.894 --> 40:41.188
I'm no different from them.

40:44.483 --> 40:45.985
Yes, you are, kiddo.

40:47.820 --> 40:49.864
You were picked on for no reason.

40:50.573 --> 40:52.741
Those who bullied you

40:53.492 --> 40:57.204
and the adults who knew but silenced you
are the ones at fault.

40:57.830 --> 41:00.249
So don't be regretful

41:01.000 --> 41:02.209
or feel remorseful.

41:37.244 --> 41:39.330
-He's crazy!
-Fuck this!

41:39.413 --> 41:41.999
I recorded everything, you motherfucker.

41:42.500 --> 41:44.376
Die, you fucking bastards.

41:44.960 --> 41:46.170
Jun-hyeong!

41:46.253 --> 41:48.255
Jun-hyeong, I'm sorry!

41:48.339 --> 41:49.507
Jun-hyeong!

41:52.009 --> 41:53.302
Fuck this!

41:58.098 --> 41:59.475
-The ERPB is here.
-It's him.

41:59.558 --> 42:00.935
We're safe now.

42:01.519 --> 42:03.020
You just can't own up, can you?

42:08.692 --> 42:09.860
I told you, didn't I?

42:09.944 --> 42:13.447
Remorse is something you do
with your body, not your mind.

42:17.201 --> 42:18.035
Are you crazy?

42:18.118 --> 42:19.745
The gasoline.

42:20.329 --> 42:21.330
What about it?

42:25.167 --> 42:26.544
Isn't this why you poured it?

43:04.498 --> 43:07.793
Please help me! I'm sorry!

43:09.461 --> 43:10.754
I was wrong!

43:11.463 --> 43:13.716
Please help me!

43:19.972 --> 43:21.557
Please help me!

43:21.640 --> 43:23.475
It's all my fault.

43:23.559 --> 43:25.769
I'm sorry!

43:45.331 --> 43:48.500
Why the hell are you taking it
this far with me? Why?

43:49.084 --> 43:50.252
And what about you?

43:51.170 --> 43:53.547
Why did you take it so far with Dae-seok?

44:01.639 --> 44:03.849
Dae-seok was afraid of dying too.

44:04.391 --> 44:05.225
Just like you.

44:07.436 --> 44:09.146
But he still made that choice

44:09.647 --> 44:11.940
because of a scumbag like you.

44:14.068 --> 44:18.072
WITH VIGOR, HOLDING HOPEFUL DREAMS CLOSE

44:25.037 --> 44:27.748
If you're finding the bullying
so difficult to deal with,

44:27.831 --> 44:29.667
how about moving to a different school?

44:29.750 --> 44:32.503
Excuse me?
Why should my child move to a new school?

44:33.545 --> 44:37.466
The bully should switch schools.
Why should the victim go?

44:40.219 --> 44:43.514
You can't just cancel your order
all of a sudden like this.

44:43.597 --> 44:46.850
I just don't understand what's going on
with our vendors.

44:48.769 --> 44:49.978
I'm sorry.

44:50.062 --> 44:51.730
-Please go easy on my dad.
-Get lost.

44:51.814 --> 44:53.399
-Shut up.
-Ask your dad.

44:53.482 --> 44:55.442
Ask him to go easy on my dad
this one time.

44:55.526 --> 44:59.238
Why are you asking me?
I'm just a helpless jerk without my dad.

44:59.321 --> 45:00.698
I'm really sorry.

45:00.781 --> 45:04.284
What can I do to make it up to you?
I'll do whatever you say.

45:06.787 --> 45:08.163
Go fucking die, then.

45:32.312 --> 45:35.357
Making the students
realize the full extent of their actions

45:35.441 --> 45:38.944
by giving them
a taste of their own medicine

45:39.027 --> 45:41.780
and making them take responsibility
for those actions.

45:42.322 --> 45:44.616
This is the true education…

45:46.702 --> 45:48.662
that the ERPB seeks.

45:59.339 --> 46:01.675
But no matter what you do to make amends…

46:04.303 --> 46:06.472
Dae-seok
can never be brought back to life.

46:08.682 --> 46:11.977
The least you can do is carry that burden
for the rest of your life.

46:13.395 --> 46:15.397
That's the only way to make it fair.

46:21.487 --> 46:23.238
This is the hell you created.

46:23.322 --> 46:24.907
See how you like living there.

46:41.089 --> 46:43.592
The police reopened Dae-seok's case

46:43.675 --> 46:46.720
and arrested those who bullied Dae-seok,
including Ryu Jun-hyeong.

46:46.804 --> 46:49.223
You told me to trust you,
you fucking bitch!

46:49.306 --> 46:50.516
And for the first time…

46:50.599 --> 46:51.558
He's not here.

46:51.642 --> 46:53.936
…the principal took accountability
like a grown-up.

46:54.019 --> 46:55.521
-I said he's not here.
-Mr. Kim!

46:55.604 --> 46:57.064
What are you doing down there?

46:58.190 --> 47:00.150
On the ERPB website,

47:00.234 --> 47:03.737
Ryu Jun-hyeong's bullying
was made public for everyone to see.

47:07.491 --> 47:11.370
And they say those records
will never be erased

47:11.453 --> 47:13.664
unless the victims forgive them.

47:17.584 --> 47:20.879
That was how the ERPB
ended their guidance at Daehan High.

47:26.426 --> 47:30.222
After that day, we never saw
the inspector at school again.

48:38.832 --> 48:41.293
THE LATE CHOI GA-YUN
1995.07.25 - 2024.11.27

48:41.376 --> 48:43.670
WE WILL NOT FORGET

50:33.697 --> 50:38.702
Subtitle translation by: Lisa Kim
